# event-stream-smoke — EAV port (apps/event-stream-smoke, semsc v0.1).
#
# FULL 1:1 port of the 4-operation standard.event smoke app: the
# one-emitter-to-many-listeners async flow (open a stream, create two
# subscriptions, start both receives, append one event, observe both
# subscriptions complete, run two named listeners, acknowledge + close), plus
# the eventIdGreaterThan comparison and the two listener operations themselves.
# Every event.* call is a `task` (EAV async = start/join, README §13) converted
# against sigs/standard.event.semsig. The original's resource-first inline
# `capability NAME RES ACTION` rows become EAV `capability`/`grants ACTION RES`
# + `uses` pairs (§8).
#
# Event *execution* is deferred: the event stream/subscription runtime is not
# specified in v0.3 (§27), so the event.* targets stay external (unlowered) and
# the listeners never receive a real event. The whole app parses + lints clean
# as `target console`; when the event runtime lands, the event.* intrinsics gain
# bodies and this source runs unchanged. (X-046)
#
# Per-task `timeout`/`cancelOn` and the v0.1 console.writeLine error path are
# dropped: EAV tasks carry no per-task timeout/cancel token and console.writeLine
# is infallible (void) — language differences, not feature reductions.


appEventStreamSmoke is module
appEventStreamSmoke path apps.eventStreamSmoke
appEventStreamSmoke exports main
appEventStreamSmoke purpose "Drive standard.event one-emitter-to-many-listeners async flow"
appEventStreamSmoke invariant "Every standard.event operation is started and joined; only listeners write console"

ExitCode is alias
ExitCode for Int32
ExitCode purpose "Process exit status"

EventStreamHandle is alias
EventStreamHandle for OpaquePointer
EventStreamHandle purpose "An opaque event stream handle (deferred runtime)"

EventSubscriptionHandle is alias
EventSubscriptionHandle for OpaquePointer
EventSubscriptionHandle purpose "An opaque subscription handle (deferred runtime)"

EventOutputBuffer is alias
EventOutputBuffer for OpaquePointer
EventOutputBuffer purpose "A caller-owned output buffer for received event fields (may be null)"

EventStreamName is alias
EventStreamName for String
EventStreamName purpose "A process-stream name"

EventTypeName is alias
EventTypeName for String
EventTypeName purpose "An event type name"

EventKey is alias
EventKey for String
EventKey purpose "An event partition key"

EventPayloadJson is alias
EventPayloadJson for String
EventPayloadJson purpose "An event payload encoded as JSON text"

EventId is alias
EventId for Int64
EventId purpose "A monotonically increasing event id (0 = none)"

EventQueueCapacity is alias
EventQueueCapacity for Int64
EventQueueCapacity purpose "The bounded queue depth of a stream or subscription"

EventBufferCapacity is alias
EventBufferCapacity for Int64
EventBufferCapacity purpose "The byte capacity of an output buffer (0 for a null buffer)"

EventStatusCode is alias
EventStatusCode for Int64
EventStatusCode purpose "A status code returned by acknowledge/close operations"

appEventStreamReader is capability
appEventStreamReader grants read event.stream
appEventStreamReader purpose "Authority to subscribe to the smoke app event stream"

appEventStreamWriter is capability
appEventStreamWriter grants write event.stream
appEventStreamWriter purpose "Authority to append the smoke app event"

appEventStreamOpener is capability
appEventStreamOpener grants open event.stream
appEventStreamOpener purpose "Authority to open the smoke app event stream"

appEventStreamCloser is capability
appEventStreamCloser grants close event.stream
appEventStreamCloser purpose "Authority to close the smoke app event stream"

appEventSubscriptionReader is capability
appEventSubscriptionReader grants read event.subscription
appEventSubscriptionReader purpose "Authority to receive smoke events from subscriptions"

appEventSubscriptionOpener is capability
appEventSubscriptionOpener grants open event.subscription
appEventSubscriptionOpener purpose "Authority to open smoke event subscriptions"

appEventSubscriptionWriter is capability
appEventSubscriptionWriter grants write event.subscription
appEventSubscriptionWriter purpose "Authority to acknowledge smoke event subscriptions"

appEventSubscriptionCloser is capability
appEventSubscriptionCloser grants close event.subscription
appEventSubscriptionCloser purpose "Authority to close smoke event subscriptions"

appEventHeapAllocator is capability
appEventHeapAllocator grants allocate heap
appEventHeapAllocator purpose "Authority for standard.event calls that allocate runtime handles"

appEventHeapFree is capability
appEventHeapFree grants free heap
appEventHeapFree purpose "Authority for standard.event calls that release runtime handles"

appEventOutputBufferWriter is capability
appEventOutputBufferWriter grants write memory.buffer
appEventOutputBufferWriter purpose "Authority for receiveEvent output buffer writes, even when null buffers are passed"

appConsoleStdoutWriter is capability
appConsoleStdoutWriter grants write console.stdout
appConsoleStdoutWriter purpose "Authority for listener operations to print proof that they ran"

smokeStreamName is storage module immutable EventStreamName "app.event-stream-smoke"
smokeEventType is storage module immutable EventTypeName "smoke.event.created"
smokeEventKey is storage module immutable EventKey "demo"
smokePayloadJson is storage module immutable EventPayloadJson "{\"message\":\"hello event\"}"
smokeQueueCapacity is storage module immutable EventQueueCapacity 16
zeroEventId is storage module immutable EventId 0
nullEventOutputBuffer is storage module immutable EventOutputBuffer 0
nullEventOutputCapacity is storage module immutable EventBufferCapacity 0
successExitCode is storage module immutable ExitCode 0
failedExitCode is storage module immutable ExitCode 1
firstListenerText is storage module immutable String "listener-one handled smoke.event.created"
secondListenerText is storage module immutable String "listener-two handled smoke.event.created"

eventIdGreaterThan is operation
eventIdGreaterThan in left EventId
eventIdGreaterThan in right EventId
eventIdGreaterThan out Bool
eventIdGreaterThan memory heap no
eventIdGreaterThan async no
eventIdGreaterThan purpose "Compare two event ids and report whether left is greater"
eventIdGreaterThan invariant "Turns EventId receive results into explicit Bool branch conditions"
eventIdGreaterThan do compareEventIdsCall
eventIdGreaterThan return eventIdIsGreater

compareEventIdsCall is call
compareEventIdsCall in eventIdGreaterThan
compareEventIdsCall invokes compare.greaterThanInt64
compareEventIdsCall arg left EventId left
compareEventIdsCall arg right EventId right
compareEventIdsCall out eventIdIsGreater Bool

listenerOneHandleSmokeEvent is operation
listenerOneHandleSmokeEvent in receivedEventId EventId
listenerOneHandleSmokeEvent out Int32
listenerOneHandleSmokeEvent effect write console.stdout
listenerOneHandleSmokeEvent uses appConsoleStdoutWriter
listenerOneHandleSmokeEvent memory heap no
listenerOneHandleSmokeEvent async yes
listenerOneHandleSmokeEvent purpose "Execute listener-one code after the first subscription receives the smoke event"
listenerOneHandleSmokeEvent invariant "The first named listener; no hidden callback closure"
listenerOneHandleSmokeEvent let listenerOneNoEventStatus immutable Int32 1
listenerOneHandleSmokeEvent let listenerOneSuccessStatus immutable Int32 0
listenerOneHandleSmokeEvent start listenerOneHasEventTask
listenerOneHandleSmokeEvent join listenerOneHasEventTask
listenerOneHandleSmokeEvent branch if listenerOneHasEvent goto listenerOneReceivedEvent
listenerOneHandleSmokeEvent return listenerOneNoEventStatus
listenerOneHandleSmokeEvent at listenerOneReceivedEvent do listenerOneWriteCall
listenerOneHandleSmokeEvent return listenerOneSuccessStatus

listenerOneHasEventTask is task
listenerOneHasEventTask in listenerOneHandleSmokeEvent
listenerOneHasEventTask invokes eventIdGreaterThan
listenerOneHasEventTask arg left EventId receivedEventId
listenerOneHasEventTask arg right EventId zeroEventId
listenerOneHasEventTask out listenerOneHasEvent Bool

listenerOneWriteCall is call
listenerOneWriteCall in listenerOneHandleSmokeEvent
listenerOneWriteCall invokes console.writeLine
listenerOneWriteCall arg text String firstListenerText

listenerTwoHandleSmokeEvent is operation
listenerTwoHandleSmokeEvent in receivedEventId EventId
listenerTwoHandleSmokeEvent out Int32
listenerTwoHandleSmokeEvent effect write console.stdout
listenerTwoHandleSmokeEvent uses appConsoleStdoutWriter
listenerTwoHandleSmokeEvent memory heap no
listenerTwoHandleSmokeEvent async yes
listenerTwoHandleSmokeEvent purpose "Execute listener-two code after the second subscription receives the same event"
listenerTwoHandleSmokeEvent invariant "The second named listener; proves one event fans out to multiple handlers"
listenerTwoHandleSmokeEvent let listenerTwoNoEventStatus immutable Int32 1
listenerTwoHandleSmokeEvent let listenerTwoSuccessStatus immutable Int32 0
listenerTwoHandleSmokeEvent start listenerTwoHasEventTask
listenerTwoHandleSmokeEvent join listenerTwoHasEventTask
listenerTwoHandleSmokeEvent branch if listenerTwoHasEvent goto listenerTwoReceivedEvent
listenerTwoHandleSmokeEvent return listenerTwoNoEventStatus
listenerTwoHandleSmokeEvent at listenerTwoReceivedEvent do listenerTwoWriteCall
listenerTwoHandleSmokeEvent return listenerTwoSuccessStatus

listenerTwoHasEventTask is task
listenerTwoHasEventTask in listenerTwoHandleSmokeEvent
listenerTwoHasEventTask invokes eventIdGreaterThan
listenerTwoHasEventTask arg left EventId receivedEventId
listenerTwoHasEventTask arg right EventId zeroEventId
listenerTwoHasEventTask out listenerTwoHasEvent Bool

listenerTwoWriteCall is call
listenerTwoWriteCall in listenerTwoHandleSmokeEvent
listenerTwoWriteCall invokes console.writeLine
listenerTwoWriteCall arg text String secondListenerText

main is operation
main out ExitCode
main effect open event.stream
main effect read event.stream
main effect write event.stream
main effect close event.stream
main effect open event.subscription
main effect read event.subscription
main effect write event.subscription
main effect close event.subscription
main effect allocate heap
main effect free heap
main effect write memory.buffer
main effect write console.stdout
main uses appEventStreamOpener
main uses appEventStreamReader
main uses appEventStreamWriter
main uses appEventStreamCloser
main uses appEventSubscriptionOpener
main uses appEventSubscriptionReader
main uses appEventSubscriptionWriter
main uses appEventSubscriptionCloser
main uses appEventHeapAllocator
main uses appEventHeapFree
main uses appEventOutputBufferWriter
main uses appConsoleStdoutWriter
main memory heap yes
main async yes
main purpose "Start two receives, append one event, observe both subscriptions complete, run two listeners"
main invariant "All standard.event operations are started and joined; only listeners write console"
main start openSmokeStreamTask
main join openSmokeStreamTask
main start firstSubscribeTask
main join firstSubscribeTask
main start secondSubscribeTask
main join secondSubscribeTask
main start appendSmokeEventTask
main join appendSmokeEventTask
main start firstReceiveTask
main join firstReceiveTask
main start secondReceiveTask
main join secondReceiveTask
main start firstReceivePositiveTask
main join firstReceivePositiveTask
main branch if firstReceivePositive goto firstReceiveSucceeded
main return failedExitCode
main at firstReceiveSucceeded start secondReceivePositiveTask
main join secondReceivePositiveTask
main branch if secondReceivePositive goto secondReceiveSucceeded
main return failedExitCode
main at secondReceiveSucceeded start firstListenerTask
main start secondListenerTask
main join firstListenerTask
main join secondListenerTask
main start acknowledgeFirstTask
main join acknowledgeFirstTask
main start acknowledgeSecondTask
main join acknowledgeSecondTask
main start closeFirstSubscriptionTask
main join closeFirstSubscriptionTask
main start closeSecondSubscriptionTask
main join closeSecondSubscriptionTask
main start closeSmokeStreamTask
main join closeSmokeStreamTask
main return successExitCode

openSmokeStreamTask is task
openSmokeStreamTask in main
openSmokeStreamTask invokes event.openProcessStream
openSmokeStreamTask arg streamName EventStreamName smokeStreamName
openSmokeStreamTask arg queueCapacity EventQueueCapacity smokeQueueCapacity
openSmokeStreamTask out smokeStream EventStreamHandle

firstSubscribeTask is task
firstSubscribeTask in main
firstSubscribeTask invokes event.subscribeStream
firstSubscribeTask arg stream EventStreamHandle smokeStream
firstSubscribeTask arg eventType EventTypeName smokeEventType
firstSubscribeTask arg eventKey EventKey smokeEventKey
firstSubscribeTask arg afterEventId EventId zeroEventId
firstSubscribeTask arg queueCapacity EventQueueCapacity smokeQueueCapacity
firstSubscribeTask out firstSubscription EventSubscriptionHandle

secondSubscribeTask is task
secondSubscribeTask in main
secondSubscribeTask invokes event.subscribeStream
secondSubscribeTask arg stream EventStreamHandle smokeStream
secondSubscribeTask arg eventType EventTypeName smokeEventType
secondSubscribeTask arg eventKey EventKey smokeEventKey
secondSubscribeTask arg afterEventId EventId zeroEventId
secondSubscribeTask arg queueCapacity EventQueueCapacity smokeQueueCapacity
secondSubscribeTask out secondSubscription EventSubscriptionHandle

firstReceiveTask is task
firstReceiveTask in main
firstReceiveTask invokes event.receiveEvent
firstReceiveTask arg subscription EventSubscriptionHandle firstSubscription
firstReceiveTask arg outEventType EventOutputBuffer nullEventOutputBuffer
firstReceiveTask arg outEventTypeCapacity EventBufferCapacity nullEventOutputCapacity
firstReceiveTask arg outEventKey EventOutputBuffer nullEventOutputBuffer
firstReceiveTask arg outEventKeyCapacity EventBufferCapacity nullEventOutputCapacity
firstReceiveTask arg outPayloadJson EventOutputBuffer nullEventOutputBuffer
firstReceiveTask arg outPayloadCapacity EventBufferCapacity nullEventOutputCapacity
firstReceiveTask out firstReceivedEventId EventId

secondReceiveTask is task
secondReceiveTask in main
secondReceiveTask invokes event.receiveEvent
secondReceiveTask arg subscription EventSubscriptionHandle secondSubscription
secondReceiveTask arg outEventType EventOutputBuffer nullEventOutputBuffer
secondReceiveTask arg outEventTypeCapacity EventBufferCapacity nullEventOutputCapacity
secondReceiveTask arg outEventKey EventOutputBuffer nullEventOutputBuffer
secondReceiveTask arg outEventKeyCapacity EventBufferCapacity nullEventOutputCapacity
secondReceiveTask arg outPayloadJson EventOutputBuffer nullEventOutputBuffer
secondReceiveTask arg outPayloadCapacity EventBufferCapacity nullEventOutputCapacity
secondReceiveTask out secondReceivedEventId EventId

appendSmokeEventTask is task
appendSmokeEventTask in main
appendSmokeEventTask invokes event.appendEvent
appendSmokeEventTask arg stream EventStreamHandle smokeStream
appendSmokeEventTask arg eventType EventTypeName smokeEventType
appendSmokeEventTask arg eventKey EventKey smokeEventKey
appendSmokeEventTask arg payloadJson EventPayloadJson smokePayloadJson
appendSmokeEventTask discards "the emitted event id is not needed by the smoke"

firstReceivePositiveTask is task
firstReceivePositiveTask in main
firstReceivePositiveTask invokes eventIdGreaterThan
firstReceivePositiveTask arg left EventId firstReceivedEventId
firstReceivePositiveTask arg right EventId zeroEventId
firstReceivePositiveTask out firstReceivePositive Bool

secondReceivePositiveTask is task
secondReceivePositiveTask in main
secondReceivePositiveTask invokes eventIdGreaterThan
secondReceivePositiveTask arg left EventId secondReceivedEventId
secondReceivePositiveTask arg right EventId zeroEventId
secondReceivePositiveTask out secondReceivePositive Bool

firstListenerTask is task
firstListenerTask in main
firstListenerTask invokes listenerOneHandleSmokeEvent
firstListenerTask arg receivedEventId EventId firstReceivedEventId
firstListenerTask discards "listener status is observed by the smoke, not the exit code"

secondListenerTask is task
secondListenerTask in main
secondListenerTask invokes listenerTwoHandleSmokeEvent
secondListenerTask arg receivedEventId EventId secondReceivedEventId
secondListenerTask discards "listener status is observed by the smoke, not the exit code"

acknowledgeFirstTask is task
acknowledgeFirstTask in main
acknowledgeFirstTask invokes event.acknowledgeEvent
acknowledgeFirstTask arg subscription EventSubscriptionHandle firstSubscription
acknowledgeFirstTask arg eventId EventId firstReceivedEventId
acknowledgeFirstTask discards "acknowledge status is not part of the exit code"

acknowledgeSecondTask is task
acknowledgeSecondTask in main
acknowledgeSecondTask invokes event.acknowledgeEvent
acknowledgeSecondTask arg subscription EventSubscriptionHandle secondSubscription
acknowledgeSecondTask arg eventId EventId secondReceivedEventId
acknowledgeSecondTask discards "acknowledge status is not part of the exit code"

closeFirstSubscriptionTask is task
closeFirstSubscriptionTask in main
closeFirstSubscriptionTask invokes event.closeSubscription
closeFirstSubscriptionTask arg subscription EventSubscriptionHandle firstSubscription
closeFirstSubscriptionTask discards "close status is not part of the exit code"

closeSecondSubscriptionTask is task
closeSecondSubscriptionTask in main
closeSecondSubscriptionTask invokes event.closeSubscription
closeSecondSubscriptionTask arg subscription EventSubscriptionHandle secondSubscription
closeSecondSubscriptionTask discards "close status is not part of the exit code"

closeSmokeStreamTask is task
closeSmokeStreamTask in main
closeSmokeStreamTask invokes event.closeStream
closeSmokeStreamTask arg stream EventStreamHandle smokeStream
closeSmokeStreamTask discards "close status is not part of the exit code"
